
# 🛡️ Smart Military Camp Perimeter Monitoring System

An **IoT-based defensive perimeter monitoring system** designed to detect suspicious movement, vibration, unauthorized entry, and sensor tampering around a secured military/camp perimeter.

The system uses distributed IoT sensor nodes, an IoT gateway, a backend server, and a real-time monitoring dashboard to provide early alerts to authorized security personnel.

> **Project Type:** IoT + AI/ML + Embedded Systems + Web Dashboard
> **Purpose:** Defensive monitoring and security research
> **Status:** Academic/Prototype Project

