# ⚠️ Limitations

This is an **academic prototype**, not a certified military security system.

Real-world deployment would require:

* Professional security assessment
* Reliable communication infrastructure
* Environmental protection
* Hardware certification
* Redundant systems
* Cybersecurity testing
* Authorized operational procedures

Sensor-based systems can also generate false positives, so real-world security decisions should not depend solely on automated alerts.

